# test: update_two_profiles
# description: Replace the executable and resume both profiles while preserving an older suspended session

## Environment

config:
  name: relay
  cloud_relay: true
  update_version: 999.0.0

config:
  name: local
  profiles: [personal, work]
  suspended_agent: already-parked

directory:
  name: project

terminal:
  name: Personal
  config: local
  cwd: project

terminal:
  name: Work
  config: local
  cwd: project

terminal:
  name: Admin
  config: local

## Test

@Personal
> amux --profile personal new test-agent --name personal-agent
> before personal
before personal
echo: before personal

@Work
> amux --profile work new test-agent --name work-agent
> before work
before work
echo: before work

@Admin
> amux --profile personal list
@@retry 8000 100
Running agents:
  personal-agent [test-agent] - $project.path
An update is available (999.0.0 vs $amux.version). Run 'amux update' to update.
Updating will suspend and resume all running agents.

> amux --profile work list
@@retry 8000 100
Running agents:
  work-agent [test-agent] - $project.path
An update is available (999.0.0 vs $amux.version). Run 'amux update' to update.
Updating will suspend and resume all running agents.

> amux update
@@contains E2E replacement fixture
@@contains Suspended 2 agent(s).
@@contains Server shutting down.
@@contains Updated to v999.0.0.
@@contains Restarting server...
@@contains Resumed 2 agent(s).

